# The same rule genesis seeds into every dev repo (`templates/gitattributes`,
# which carries the reasoning). Genesis needs it too: the seeded scripts are
# copied out of this checkout, and genesis runs its own `.genesis/scripts/`
# under `genesis serve`, so a Windows clone with `core.autocrlf=true` would
# otherwise hand CRLF to both (issue #158). `tests/e2e/test_line_endings.py`
# holds the two copies to the same rule.
*.sh text eol=lf
